{
  "_note": "美债 10 年(财政部收盘):10 年为主数,5 / 30 年为辅;日变化 = 最新两行相减,近 1 个月迷你线 = 最近 22 个收盘。文件名沿用 live(三张组件的 depends 指向它)。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "zh",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "语言:文案在取数层按语言出。切语言 = 整盘重取,数据缓存含 locale。没注入 @app 时按英文(overseas-first §2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy)]"
      },
      "_note": "今年(按设备时区;跨年那几个小时差一天无妨:两年的文件都会取)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${y0}-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "去年。⚠️ 进 URL 的数字过 parseNumber(Android calc 返回 2025.0)。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tc",
      "action": "request",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/daily-treasury-rates.csv/${y0}/all?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve&field_tdr_date_value=${y0}&page&_format=csv",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "string",
        "timeout": "10000",
        "header": {
          "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(memory actionflow-concurrent-late-merge)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tok",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${tc},),Date),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${tok},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "treasury unavailable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "当年文件必须是 CSV(以列头 Date 开头);拿到的是错误页 / 空串 = 取数失败(G26)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tA",
        "value": "$[split::(replaceAll::(${tc},([0-9]+/[0-9]+/[0-9]+)\\,(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)([^\\,\\n]*)\\,(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)([^\\,\\n]*)\\,(?:[^\\,\\n]*\\,)([^\\,\\n]*)[^\\n]*,$1~$2~$3~$4),\\n)]"
      },
      "_note": "每行压成「MM/DD/YYYY~5 年~10 年~30 年」再切行(第 0 行是列头):原文留在数据域里每个节点都要复制一遍(df-perf)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "tc"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},1),)]"
      },
      "_note": "最新一行(CSV 倒序)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "td1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${r1},~),0),)]"
      },
      "_note": "最新一行的日期 MM/DD/YYYY。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fvxR",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${r1},~),1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fvxV",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${fvxR},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${fvxR},0.00),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tnxR",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${r1},~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tnxV",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tnxR},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${tnxR},0.00),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tyxR",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${r1},~),3),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tyxV",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tyxR},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${tyxR},0.00),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${tnxV},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "treasury 10y missing"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "主数 10 年取不到 = 取数失败(G26)。5 / 30 年缺了只让那一格写 --。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},1),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv2",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},2),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv3",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},3),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv4",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},4),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv5",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},5),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv6",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},6),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv7",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},7),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv8",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},8),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv9",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},9),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv10",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},10),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv11",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},11),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv12",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},12),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv13",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},13),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv14",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},14),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv15",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},15),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv16",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},16),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv17",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},17),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv18",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},18),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv19",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},19),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv20",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},20),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv21",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},21),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tv22",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${tA},22),),~),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bpv",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv1},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv2},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),round::(calc::((${tv1}-${tv2})*100)),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bpn",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),parseNumber::(if::(ge::(${bpv},0),${bpv},calc::(0-${bpv})),0),)]"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 进文本的数字过 parseNumber(x,0):Android 上 round 返回 double,直接拼会渲成「4.0 基点」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bpt",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),--,if::(eq::(${bpn},0),if::(eq::(${zh},1),持平,flat),if::(gt::(${bpv},0),if::(eq::(${zh},1),+${bpn} 基点,+${bpn} bp),if::(eq::(${zh},1),−${bpn} 基点,−${bpn} bp))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bpu",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),n,if::(gt::(${bpv},0),1,0))]"
      },
      "_note": "方向:1 涨 / 0 跌 / n 无数(不留空:空键在 CLI 里报「字段为空」,且 rckit.col 对 n 同样走灰)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bpf",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),0,if::(eq::(${bpn},0),1,0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bps",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),--,if::(eq::(${bpn},0),0,if::(gt::(${bpv},0),+${bpn},−${bpn})))]"
      },
      "_note": "微档底行的短写法(「+5」,单位在词表里)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(${td1},)),9),connect::(subString::(${td1},0,2),-,subString::(${td1},3,5)),--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lLo",
        "value": "$[min::(findNotEmpty::(${tv22},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv21},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv20},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv19},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv18},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv17},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv16},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv15},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv14},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv13},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv12},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv11},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv10},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv9},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv8},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv7},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv6},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv5},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv4},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv3},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv2},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv1},${tv1}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lHi",
        "value": "$[max::(findNotEmpty::(${tv22},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv21},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv20},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv19},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv18},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv17},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv16},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv15},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv14},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv13},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv12},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv11},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv10},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv9},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv8},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv7},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv6},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv5},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv4},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv3},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv2},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv1},${tv1}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lOk",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv22},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv1},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),gt::(${lHi},${lLo})),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "线画不画:凑得满 22 个收盘(年初几天凑不满就不画)、不是一条平线。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv22},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv21},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv20},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv19},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y4",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv18},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y5",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv17},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y6",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv16},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y7",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv15},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l21y8",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lHi}-findNotEmpty::(${tv14},${tv1}))/(${lHi}-${lLo})*22),0.0),13)]"
      }
    },
    {
